WEBVTT

00:06.506 --> 00:08.508
[theme music playing]

00:29.028 --> 00:30.321
[line ringing]

00:42.333 --> 00:46.963
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

00:47.881 --> 00:49.883
I've never been…

00:50.884 --> 00:53.303
more curious about a man before.

00:53.386 --> 00:54.554
[breath trembling]

00:55.430 --> 00:56.431
[exhales]

00:56.514 --> 00:58.516
[dramatic music playing]

00:59.184 --> 01:01.728
Forget about getting arrested, 406.

01:02.687 --> 01:04.355
I promise,

01:06.066 --> 01:07.692
I'm going to catch you.

01:09.486 --> 01:10.779
[timer rings]

01:12.238 --> 01:13.073
[line disconnects]

01:17.786 --> 01:18.870
[breathing heavily]

01:18.953 --> 01:20.080
Wait…

01:20.830 --> 01:24.000
Am I screwed, or did he fall for it?

01:27.253 --> 01:28.296
[music ends]

01:28.379 --> 01:29.672
[sighs wearily]

01:32.509 --> 01:34.219
[breathing heavily]

01:36.554 --> 01:37.889
[dramatic music playing]

01:37.972 --> 01:39.098
[sighs]

01:50.860 --> 01:51.778
[sighs]

01:58.868 --> 01:59.953
[sighs]

02:17.178 --> 02:19.389
[indistinct chatter]

02:22.100 --> 02:23.184
[music ends]

02:24.185 --> 02:25.311
[exhales]

02:31.067 --> 02:33.027
[Hee-joo] What… What's he doing?

02:37.448 --> 02:38.825
Are you hiding something from me?

02:39.784 --> 02:40.869
[Hee-joo] Hiding something?

02:41.953 --> 02:43.204
Give me the phone.

02:44.622 --> 02:45.540
[Hee-joo] The phone?

02:46.082 --> 02:47.167
Give it to me.

03:01.931 --> 03:03.850
I want you to answer my questions.

03:08.897 --> 03:09.731
Yesterday,

03:10.815 --> 03:11.858
was there a car accident?

03:16.446 --> 03:17.322
What time?

03:19.324 --> 03:20.825
[Hee-joo] Between 6 and 7 p.m.

03:22.577 --> 03:23.411
[scoffs]

03:24.579 --> 03:25.413
So…

03:26.497 --> 03:28.166
there really was an accident.

03:28.249 --> 03:29.167
[inhales]

03:30.251 --> 03:31.085
Were you hurt?

03:33.212 --> 03:34.297
[tapping on phone]

03:39.469 --> 03:41.471
[soft music playing]

04:01.950 --> 04:02.867
What's this?

04:05.912 --> 04:07.455
I asked you what this is!

04:09.916 --> 04:10.750
No.

04:11.626 --> 04:12.877
You don't have to answer.

04:15.672 --> 04:16.506
[exhales]

04:19.342 --> 04:20.176
Who was he?

04:20.718 --> 04:21.803
Did you see his face?

04:23.846 --> 04:26.224
[Hee-joo] His face was covered,
so I couldn't see it.

04:31.437 --> 04:32.522
[Sa-eon] Tell me…

04:34.315 --> 04:35.441
what that bastard did.

04:37.277 --> 04:38.945
Did he threaten you with a knife?

04:39.028 --> 04:40.196
That he would kill you?

04:41.948 --> 04:42.782
[scoffs]

04:45.118 --> 04:46.494
[dramatic music playing]

04:46.577 --> 04:48.204
If something like that happened,

04:48.997 --> 04:50.415
why didn't you tell me?

04:52.375 --> 04:55.920
[Hee-joo] You said to call back
when there's a corpse.

04:58.506 --> 05:00.216
Did you see anyone suspicious just now?

05:01.467 --> 05:03.678
Did anyone follow,
approach, or talk to you?

05:05.555 --> 05:06.556
[sighs]

05:10.018 --> 05:12.478
Make sure you keep
your bodyguard with you.

05:16.107 --> 05:17.942
And get checked at the hospital.

05:22.989 --> 05:25.658
[Hee-joo] He doesn't know, right?

05:27.827 --> 05:28.745
[breath trembling]

05:31.789 --> 05:32.665
[music ends]

05:37.211 --> 05:38.046
[exhales]

05:41.299 --> 05:44.052
SECURITY TEAM 1 LEE JEONG-WON

05:44.135 --> 05:45.136
[line ringing]

05:47.180 --> 05:49.849
Hong Hee-joo's going home.
Come to the second floor.

05:50.683 --> 05:51.601
[line disconnects]

05:52.268 --> 05:53.394
[phone vibrating]

05:55.813 --> 05:58.024
- How did it go?
- [Do-jae] It won't be easy.

05:58.107 --> 06:00.693
The IP was bouncing around
in less than ten minutes.

06:00.777 --> 06:02.570
I think they're operating
as an organization.

06:02.653 --> 06:04.030
- An organization?
- [Do-jae] Yes.

06:04.113 --> 06:05.698
- Do you have any ideas?
- [Sa-eon sighs]

06:06.616 --> 06:08.659
He knew more about me than I expected.

06:08.743 --> 06:10.161
Things only family knows.

06:10.745 --> 06:14.165
Secure the lists of the guests
and service providers for the event.

06:14.248 --> 06:16.209
The embassy event? Is he there now?

06:16.292 --> 06:18.086
He's pretending to be.

06:19.003 --> 06:21.047
I'll send you part of the recorded call.

06:21.130 --> 06:22.590
Try to remove the modulator.

06:24.175 --> 06:25.468
As soon as possible.

06:27.136 --> 06:28.679
EPISODE 2

06:28.763 --> 06:31.099
[Hee-joo in distorted voice]
Say something, Paik Sa-eon!

06:31.766 --> 06:32.892
[Sa-eon] What do you want?

06:33.476 --> 06:35.478
[Hee-joo] Yeah, good job.

06:35.561 --> 06:37.230
That's the correct answer.

06:37.814 --> 06:39.148
[Sa-eon] Tell me…

06:40.441 --> 06:41.734
what you want.

06:45.321 --> 06:46.739
What do you want?

06:47.323 --> 06:49.117
[Hee-joo in distorted voice]
Yeah, good job.

06:49.659 --> 06:51.327
That's the correct answer.

06:51.911 --> 06:53.162
[Sa-eon] Tell me…

06:54.122 --> 06:56.290
- what you want.
- [chuckles softly]

06:56.374 --> 06:58.209
[slow music playing]

06:58.292 --> 06:59.210
He's scared.

07:00.044 --> 07:02.088
[chuckles softly] Paik Sa-eon is scared.

07:12.181 --> 07:15.560
I guess it makes him angry
when someone touches his things.

07:18.729 --> 07:21.482
Yeah, Hong Hee-joo
really could've ended up dead.

07:21.566 --> 07:23.484
The car rolled on the slippery road!

07:23.568 --> 07:25.570
[breathing heavily]

07:26.946 --> 07:27.822
[thud over phone]

07:31.617 --> 07:32.618
Why do I care?

07:34.036 --> 07:34.871
[sighs]

07:36.080 --> 07:37.790
I've had this for two days now.

07:39.041 --> 07:40.501
He must be looking for it.

07:40.585 --> 07:41.752
I have to hurry.

07:41.836 --> 07:43.671
- [door lock beeping]
- [Hee-joo gasps]

07:44.714 --> 07:46.090
[door opens]

07:46.591 --> 07:48.342
[door closes]

07:49.635 --> 07:51.304
- [knocking on door]
- [Hee-joo gasps]

07:51.387 --> 07:52.305
[Sa-eon] Hong Hee-joo?

07:52.388 --> 07:54.390
[slow music playing]

08:01.189 --> 08:02.023
Your car key.

08:05.443 --> 08:06.736
Is it here?

08:09.322 --> 08:11.324
[suspenseful music playing]

08:17.246 --> 08:18.080
What are you doing?

08:28.341 --> 08:29.675
- [sighs in relief]
- [door closes]

08:31.886 --> 08:32.970
[car beeps]

08:33.763 --> 08:35.765
[mysterious music playing]

08:39.268 --> 08:40.686
Why does he want the car?

08:42.230 --> 08:43.356
What's he looking for?

08:51.322 --> 08:52.365
[sighs]

09:13.970 --> 09:14.804
[gasps]

09:16.722 --> 09:17.557
No way.

09:23.771 --> 09:25.064
That asshole.

09:25.147 --> 09:28.401
I have something to say to him,
so call him back now!

09:31.404 --> 09:32.863
[breathing heavily]

09:34.073 --> 09:35.449
[dramatic music playing]

09:50.298 --> 09:51.132
[music ends]

09:52.383 --> 09:53.634
[Sa-eon] I'm glad you're here.

09:54.218 --> 09:55.094
What happened?

09:55.803 --> 09:57.471
[Hee-joo] About what?

09:58.055 --> 10:00.141
Look at the car.
How did you drive it back?

10:04.437 --> 10:06.439
[suspenseful music playing]

10:23.331 --> 10:24.665
[Hee-joo] I called a tow truck.

10:27.335 --> 10:28.252
And the dashcam?

10:31.005 --> 10:31.964
Why…

10:32.965 --> 10:34.175
isn't anything recorded?

10:35.509 --> 10:36.844
[Hee-joo] There's nothing on it?

10:37.553 --> 10:39.221
[sighs] Thank goodness.

10:42.058 --> 10:43.309
[engine revving]

10:43.392 --> 10:45.186
[intense music playing]

10:53.486 --> 10:54.570
You should be…

10:55.446 --> 10:56.405
careful.

10:56.489 --> 10:57.573
[man] Sorry about that.

10:58.157 --> 10:59.742
[engine revving]

11:00.743 --> 11:01.702
[exhales]

11:06.082 --> 11:08.209
I'll get you a new car.

11:08.292 --> 11:11.045
But don't go to work from tomorrow on,
and stay at home.

11:13.881 --> 11:15.841
[Hee-joo] I can't do that.
I have to go to court.

11:17.176 --> 11:18.386
Court?

11:19.678 --> 11:20.930
[Hee-joo tapping on phone]

11:22.098 --> 11:23.432
[Hee-joo] I have to go interpret.

11:24.141 --> 11:24.975
Alone?

11:26.852 --> 11:28.396
[Hee-joo] I'm going with the director.

11:29.313 --> 11:32.149
Also, I want to keep working.

11:35.277 --> 11:36.112
[sighs]

11:37.613 --> 11:39.615
[Hee-joo] Your mother told me to quit,

11:40.491 --> 11:42.368
but I'd like to keep working, please.

11:45.663 --> 11:47.665
[slow music playing]

11:50.793 --> 11:53.379
Then keep the security staff
while you work…

11:53.462 --> 11:55.005
[Hee-joo tapping on phone]

11:56.632 --> 11:57.925
[Hee-joo] Don't make it obvious.

12:05.099 --> 12:05.933
[door beeps]

12:11.981 --> 12:14.400
ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICER PARK DO-JAE

12:14.483 --> 12:15.526
[line ringing]

12:17.945 --> 12:18.779
[Do-jae] Yes, sir.

12:18.863 --> 12:21.907
It's a personal request,
and it needs to be handled discreetly.

12:21.991 --> 12:23.617
Can I entrust you with it?

12:23.701 --> 12:25.744
Of course. Please, go ahead.

12:25.828 --> 12:28.497
There's nothing on the dashcam
from yesterday's accident.

12:28.581 --> 12:29.999
See if you can restore it.

12:30.082 --> 12:32.751
And check the traffic cameras
according to the route

12:32.835 --> 12:34.670
between 6 to 7 p.m. yesterday.

12:34.753 --> 12:35.880
Yes, sir.

12:37.214 --> 12:38.132
[line disconnects]

12:44.138 --> 12:45.514
[Kyu-jin] When will you join us?

12:47.183 --> 12:48.601
Your father's waiting.

12:50.060 --> 12:51.228
[phone vibrating]

12:52.062 --> 12:54.565
HYESEONG DAILY NEWS CHOI YEONG-JIN

12:55.316 --> 12:56.942
- [vibration stops]
- [Kyu-jin] Right.

12:57.860 --> 12:59.737
I told her to quit working.

13:00.404 --> 13:04.241
During the election period,
tell her to keep quiet and stay low.

13:04.325 --> 13:06.327
- [Sa-eon sighs]
- [Kyu-jin clicks tongue]

13:06.410 --> 13:08.913
I don't know why
I have to be bothered by her.

13:09.955 --> 13:12.208
This marriage should've never happened.

13:13.209 --> 13:15.252
Aren't we the ones who wanted
to establish ties

13:15.836 --> 13:19.757
with Chungwoon,
even if that meant switching the bride?

13:20.549 --> 13:24.553
Father was able to get this far
thanks to Chungwoon Daily News

13:25.221 --> 13:26.889
burying his scandals.

13:33.896 --> 13:34.730
Anyway,

13:35.856 --> 13:38.651
who else knows about this marriage?

13:39.818 --> 13:40.819
What?

13:40.903 --> 13:42.404
Father, you,

13:42.488 --> 13:45.366
Hee-joo's father, Hee-joo's mother,
Hee-joo…

13:46.075 --> 13:47.660
And Hong In-a.

13:49.286 --> 13:51.956
[Sa-eon] No one else knows about it,
but he does.

13:52.706 --> 13:53.707
That means…

13:53.791 --> 13:55.417
Why do you ask that?

13:57.461 --> 13:58.754
HYESEONG DAILY CHOI YEONG-JIN

13:58.837 --> 13:59.838
[phone vibrating]

14:01.340 --> 14:02.299
[sighs]

14:04.134 --> 14:06.136
It seems you've developed a bad habit.

14:08.347 --> 14:11.308
- I'm getting calls that bother me.
- [Kyu-jin scoffs]

14:11.392 --> 14:13.102
You still have a long way to go.

14:14.353 --> 14:18.315
I've taught you that impatience
is a barrier to communication.

14:19.733 --> 14:21.443
But when you get those calls,

14:21.527 --> 14:24.196
you look ready to go on a rampage.

14:24.780 --> 14:25.698
[inhales]

14:26.448 --> 14:28.701
Then, why don't you give me some advice?

14:28.784 --> 14:34.790
As our country's first negotiation expert
and a former criminal psychologist.

14:35.583 --> 14:38.669
It burst with a bang!

14:38.752 --> 14:41.755
The witness' precious testicle.

14:41.839 --> 14:44.550
[spectator] Testicle? Did his ball burst?

14:44.633 --> 14:48.971
Your Honor, the witness now must live
with the irrecoverable loss

14:49.054 --> 14:52.516
caused by the defendant's attack
with a ladle.

14:52.600 --> 14:53.559
I'm dying!

14:53.642 --> 14:56.020
What a load of bullshit!

14:57.521 --> 15:00.316
You fell on your own and burst it!

15:00.399 --> 15:01.942
Why is that my fault?

15:02.026 --> 15:03.903
You were wasted that day, as usual.

15:03.986 --> 15:06.488
And that happened
while you tried to hit me.

15:07.114 --> 15:11.035
How dare you lie in front of the judge,
you rotten bastard?

15:12.119 --> 15:13.537
[judge] Interpreter.

15:13.621 --> 15:15.414
It's not the defendant's turn to speak.

15:16.123 --> 15:16.957
Also,

15:17.833 --> 15:20.544
try to tone down the interpretation.

15:20.628 --> 15:24.089
Oh, sure. Duly noted, Your Honor.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.883
[quirky music playing]

15:25.966 --> 15:27.885
Counsel,
proceed with the cross-examination.

15:27.968 --> 15:28.802
Yes, Your Honor.

15:33.390 --> 15:34.224
Witness,

15:35.601 --> 15:38.228
do you often drink alcohol?

15:38.812 --> 15:40.105
[plaintiff] Not often.

15:40.189 --> 15:42.816
[defendant] You don't have to interpret.
I don't want to know.

15:43.943 --> 15:45.653
I don't talk with that man.

15:47.279 --> 15:50.574
- I only have fistfights with him.
- [plaintiff] I only drank a little.

15:51.241 --> 15:52.326
I don't remember.

15:53.160 --> 15:54.370
[indistinct conversation]

15:54.453 --> 15:56.038
[defendant] Isn't it funny?

15:58.207 --> 16:01.210
As a deaf person, the person
I can't communicate with is him.

16:01.293 --> 16:03.003
That's because that woman

16:03.712 --> 16:07.049
kept nagging me and wouldn't let me drink.

16:08.258 --> 16:11.595
[defendant] And he's my husband
I've lived with for decades.

16:11.679 --> 16:13.013
[plaintiff] I just pushed her.

16:13.722 --> 16:15.599
[Do-jae] After tracking all of the routes,

16:15.683 --> 16:17.935
this is the only footage
where he was spotted.

16:18.018 --> 16:19.353
[Sa-eon] Is that all?

16:24.149 --> 16:26.068
From here on,

16:26.151 --> 16:29.321
it's outside the cameras' coverage,
so nothing after this.

16:31.115 --> 16:32.157
[sighs]

16:33.117 --> 16:33.951
And the embassy?

16:35.077 --> 16:36.495
Without an official notice,

16:36.578 --> 16:39.373
we can't get the guest list,
so I called the security company.

16:39.456 --> 16:41.917
And most external employees
were part-timers.

16:43.627 --> 16:45.504
In short… [sighs]

16:47.256 --> 16:49.675
you couldn't find anything useful?

16:50.300 --> 16:51.301
I'm sorry, sir.

16:51.885 --> 16:52.845
[exhales]

16:53.804 --> 16:55.681
Should we request police cooperation?

16:57.516 --> 16:58.434
Probably not.

16:58.517 --> 17:01.770
I just think it's serious
since he threatened your wife.

17:01.854 --> 17:03.022
Mr. Park.

17:03.105 --> 17:04.690
Have you ever seen my wife?

17:06.025 --> 17:07.026
No, I haven't.

17:08.819 --> 17:12.322
Have I ever spoken of my wife, even once?

17:12.865 --> 17:13.699
No, you haven't.

17:13.782 --> 17:16.452
The entire nation
doesn't know about my wife.

17:16.535 --> 17:17.828
They're just curious.

17:18.704 --> 17:20.956
So, what do you think will happen

17:21.957 --> 17:23.167
if I go public with this?

17:24.084 --> 17:26.295
I apologize. I was thoughtless.

17:26.879 --> 17:27.713
[exhales]

17:28.464 --> 17:29.465
[phone vibrates]

17:32.926 --> 17:35.345
[Jeong-won] Hong Hee-joo's
court schedule is over.

17:40.934 --> 17:42.352
[Sa-eon] Take her home now.

17:47.357 --> 17:48.275
[Jeong-won] Yes, sir.

17:52.529 --> 17:54.531
[indistinct shouting]

17:57.993 --> 17:59.578
[shouting continues]

18:02.206 --> 18:04.291
Excuse me! Can you help us?

18:08.462 --> 18:10.130
No, stop! Let go!

18:10.214 --> 18:12.216
Come on, come help!

18:13.509 --> 18:15.260
[mysterious music playing]

18:15.344 --> 18:16.929
[indistinct shouting continues]

18:31.902 --> 18:33.487
[footsteps approaching]

18:35.322 --> 18:36.615
[footsteps stop]

18:45.707 --> 18:47.376
[footsteps approaching]

18:57.344 --> 18:59.263
[mysterious music playing]

19:10.691 --> 19:12.609
- [Jin-e] Please calm down.
- You damn woman!

19:12.693 --> 19:14.820
- What's your problem?
- Calm down.

19:14.903 --> 19:16.196
[defendant panting]

19:16.280 --> 19:17.281
Goodness.

19:18.490 --> 19:19.658
That's better.

19:19.741 --> 19:21.160
[breathing heavily]

19:21.243 --> 19:23.328
Thank you so much.

19:23.412 --> 19:24.621
Thank you so much.

19:25.914 --> 19:28.292
But where did Hee-joo go?

19:28.917 --> 19:30.919
[suspenseful music playing]

19:33.672 --> 19:35.424
Ms. Hong Hee-joo?

19:39.845 --> 19:41.722
[breathing heavily]

19:45.642 --> 19:47.394
- [breathing heavily]
- [line ringing]

19:49.021 --> 19:50.814
She's not here. Find her now!

19:50.898 --> 19:52.900
[intense music playing]

20:07.831 --> 20:09.082
[breathing heavily]

20:09.166 --> 20:10.876
Here's a list of posts from the past month

20:10.959 --> 20:12.669
with high approval ratings
from the public.

20:12.753 --> 20:13.629
[phone vibrates]

20:13.712 --> 20:15.672
First, we'll start from the top…

20:17.049 --> 20:18.050
or the lowest?

20:18.800 --> 20:20.385
Go ahead. Continue.

20:21.637 --> 20:23.013
THE PUBLIC'S TOP 10 PICK LIST

20:23.096 --> 20:25.182
[Jeong-won] I'm sorry.

20:25.265 --> 20:28.060
I'm at the courthouse,
but I can't locate Ms. Hong.

20:28.143 --> 20:30.437
[Sa-eon] What do you mean
you can't locate her?

20:30.520 --> 20:31.980
[phone vibrates]

20:33.857 --> 20:34.983
[breathing heavily]

20:36.068 --> 20:38.695
[Jeong-won] She went to the restroom,
and I lost her.

20:39.321 --> 20:40.155
[exhales]

20:40.239 --> 20:41.323
I'm sorry.

20:44.034 --> 20:47.412
[Sa-eon] Find her quickly! Request support
from the courthouse if you have to.

20:47.496 --> 20:48.747
[exhales]

20:48.830 --> 20:52.000
The current hot issue
is the punishment for dating violence.

20:52.084 --> 20:54.169
- The penalties are too light…
- [phone vibrates]

20:54.253 --> 20:55.462
[Hyeon-jin] I found her.

20:56.213 --> 20:57.714
She's with some man.

20:57.798 --> 20:58.715
A man?

20:58.799 --> 20:59.675
Excuse me?

20:59.758 --> 21:00.592
A man?

21:01.802 --> 21:04.012
Yes, mostly men.

21:04.096 --> 21:06.932
Usually, men do it
to their girlfriends or…

21:07.015 --> 21:09.476
[Sa-eon] Who is he?
What does he look like?

21:14.439 --> 21:15.440
Sorry about earlier.

21:16.400 --> 21:17.234
Did I scare you?

21:19.361 --> 21:20.904
[mysterious music playing]

21:25.158 --> 21:27.035
SECURITY TEAM LEE JEONG-WON

21:27.119 --> 21:28.537
- [music ends]
- [gasps]

21:33.625 --> 21:38.255
What was I thinking
hovering around the women's restroom?

21:39.131 --> 21:41.466
I saw you come out of the courtroom,
but I wasn't sure.

21:42.384 --> 21:43.844
But what brings you here?

21:43.927 --> 21:46.305
I had to appear as a witness.
What about you?

21:46.388 --> 21:47.764
Did you come to interpret?

21:50.100 --> 21:51.476
[suspenseful music playing]

21:51.560 --> 21:52.728
[camera shutter clicks]

21:55.647 --> 21:57.316
[camera shutter clicking]

22:01.737 --> 22:03.822
[Young-woo] People commit crimes
out of resentment.

22:03.905 --> 22:05.282
[Hyeon-jin] This is him.

22:05.365 --> 22:06.950
I think he's an acquaintance.

22:07.034 --> 22:09.411
[Young-woo] Not only are there
no provisions in place,

22:09.494 --> 22:12.205
but the legal systems also fail
to protect the victims…

22:12.831 --> 22:16.752
Which is why such crimes
continue to persist.

22:16.835 --> 22:17.669
Furthermore…

22:18.295 --> 22:21.298
Well, many cases are classified
as non-prosecutable offenses.

22:21.381 --> 22:23.133
These result in minor penalties,

22:23.216 --> 22:25.969
and the victim fears retaliatory crimes…

22:26.053 --> 22:27.596
[Hyeon-jin] He's got a good physique.

22:27.679 --> 22:29.014
He's good-looking.

22:29.556 --> 22:31.308
- [slams]
- [Young-woo's breath trembles]

22:32.059 --> 22:33.602
[Young-woo chuckles nervously]

22:33.685 --> 22:34.853
[phone vibrates]

22:36.271 --> 22:37.439
[Sa-eon] Don't take photos.

22:38.065 --> 22:40.817
I asked you to guard her,
not to spy on her.

22:40.901 --> 22:41.985
[quirky music playing]

22:42.069 --> 22:42.944
[sighs]

22:43.028 --> 22:46.156
He asked about his appearance.
What was I supposed to say?

22:46.239 --> 22:48.366
That he has two eyes, a nose, and a mouth?

22:48.450 --> 22:50.243
- Darn it.
- [Jeong-won] Mmm.

22:51.078 --> 22:52.871
He's totally my type.

22:55.624 --> 22:56.458
[sighs softly]

22:58.085 --> 23:00.087
After you suddenly cut off contact
three years ago,

23:00.712 --> 23:02.130
I looked everywhere for you.

23:04.424 --> 23:06.051
But no one knew anything.

23:08.929 --> 23:11.681
Then one day, I saw you on the news.

23:13.975 --> 23:17.270
"Sign language interpreter, Hong Hee-joo."

23:17.813 --> 23:19.147
[Sang-woo chuckles]

23:19.231 --> 23:20.941
It was great to see you.

23:21.942 --> 23:23.860
I'm sorry I didn't contact you.

23:23.944 --> 23:24.945
Mmm-mmm.

23:29.324 --> 23:30.158
Hee-joo,

23:30.617 --> 23:31.952
you're doing well, right?

23:33.578 --> 23:35.580
[mellow music playing]

23:36.373 --> 23:38.708
You're still good at signing.

23:38.792 --> 23:39.751
[Sang-woo chuckles]

23:40.335 --> 23:42.420
That's how I can talk to you.

23:46.341 --> 23:47.175
[Sang-woo] Right.

23:48.009 --> 23:49.094
Starting this week,

23:49.761 --> 23:52.639
I'm going to the station
where you interpret the news.

23:53.223 --> 23:54.683
I've taken on a new program.

23:54.766 --> 23:55.851
JI SANG-WOO

23:57.352 --> 23:58.520
What type of program?

23:58.603 --> 24:00.397
It's called "Crime Report."

24:00.480 --> 24:02.065
It covers crime cases.

24:02.149 --> 24:06.069
There's a cold case that I personally
want to solve. So I agreed to do it.

24:06.153 --> 24:06.987
Wait.

24:08.488 --> 24:09.906
Give me your number.

24:10.490 --> 24:11.992
I'll call when I go to the station.

24:15.579 --> 24:17.581
[mellow music continues playing]

24:19.374 --> 24:20.876
[Hee-joo tapping on phone]

24:25.755 --> 24:27.382
It was great to see you.

24:28.383 --> 24:29.509
[Sang-woo] Mmm.

24:37.726 --> 24:38.727
[sighs softly]

24:41.980 --> 24:44.441
[Young-woo] In addition to strengthening
related penalty laws,

24:44.524 --> 24:46.443
experts have voiced
that integrated services

24:46.526 --> 24:47.360
[phone vibrates]

24:47.444 --> 24:50.197
in psychology, healthcare,
and legal support should be provided.

24:50.864 --> 24:52.866
[Hyeon-jin] Ms. Hong
has returned home safely.

24:53.533 --> 24:57.204
I'll provide additional reports
regarding the measures and penalties.

25:04.085 --> 25:04.920
Next.

25:05.503 --> 25:06.338
Next. Okay.

25:06.421 --> 25:08.506
Next, we discussed dating violence. Well…

25:09.216 --> 25:11.176
[breathing heavily] This is about…

25:11.259 --> 25:13.094
- [clears throat] school violence.
- Wait.

25:13.178 --> 25:14.262
[Young-woo groans softly]

25:15.013 --> 25:16.514
Let's discuss this first.

25:17.599 --> 25:20.518
The sign language interpreter position
at the presidential office.

25:20.602 --> 25:21.436
I see.

25:21.519 --> 25:23.939
PRESIDENTIAL PLACEMENT
OF SIGN LANGUAGE INTERPRETER

25:24.022 --> 25:24.856
This?

25:27.484 --> 25:28.485
[phone vibrates]

25:31.029 --> 25:32.489
MOM
MISSED CALL

25:32.572 --> 25:33.907
MOM
TEXT BACK OR PICK UP THE PHONE

25:33.990 --> 25:35.909
I'M IN FRONT OF YOUR PLACE.
YOU'D BETTER…

25:38.119 --> 25:39.496
[doorbell rings]

25:42.207 --> 25:45.418
[Yeon-hui] Why didn't you pick up
the phone or go to the dermatologist?

25:45.961 --> 25:48.880
Why do you never do what I ask you to?

25:50.882 --> 25:53.635
Start taking these from today
and prepare your body.

25:54.636 --> 25:55.470
And this.

26:00.600 --> 26:02.644
[tense music playing]

26:11.778 --> 26:12.696
What do you think?

26:13.530 --> 26:14.614
It's work clothes.

26:16.658 --> 26:17.867
You're pathetic.

26:18.451 --> 26:21.454
Why do I still have to
bring things like this

26:21.538 --> 26:23.331
and teach you everything?

26:24.457 --> 26:26.334
Are you really a mother

26:26.418 --> 26:27.752
and not a pimp?

26:27.836 --> 26:29.504
What the hell are you saying?

26:30.422 --> 26:31.339
Listen carefully.

26:31.423 --> 26:34.009
When In-a ran away
and you agreed to be the sub,

26:34.092 --> 26:35.218
what did you say?

26:35.302 --> 26:36.303
[Yeon-hui scoffs]

26:36.386 --> 26:38.972
You daringly imposed a condition
about your father.

26:39.055 --> 26:41.474
That he be put in a good nursing home.

26:43.268 --> 26:45.353
That's only if you maintain this marriage

26:45.437 --> 26:47.814
and properly fulfill your duty
as Sa-eon's wife.

26:48.773 --> 26:50.275
If anything goes wrong,

26:51.026 --> 26:54.404
your father will be out in the streets
as soon as tomorrow.

26:55.155 --> 26:56.156
Do you understand?

26:58.575 --> 27:00.160
[paper rustling]

27:01.745 --> 27:03.246
Yeah, that's how you are.

27:04.122 --> 27:07.667
The moment your father is used
against you, you can't do anything.

27:10.920 --> 27:11.880
[Hee-joo] She's right.

27:12.839 --> 27:14.716
This is what a weakness is.

27:16.426 --> 27:18.595
When someone touches it, you flinch,

27:20.055 --> 27:21.723
tremble uncontrollably…

27:24.142 --> 27:26.269
and desperately try to defend it.

27:40.116 --> 27:40.950
[music ends]

27:41.743 --> 27:43.078
I'll try my best.

27:44.120 --> 27:46.122
[dramatic music playing]

28:02.222 --> 28:03.181
But, Mom,

28:04.057 --> 28:05.350
I'm so curious.

28:06.768 --> 28:08.978
Once I successfully escape this prison,

28:09.687 --> 28:11.648
what expression will you have?

28:19.280 --> 28:20.490
[Kyu-jin] It's a misconception

28:20.573 --> 28:22.700
that a strong stance
increases your chances of winning

28:22.784 --> 28:24.828
and a weak one does the opposite
in negotiations.

28:24.911 --> 28:29.207
Getting a serial killer to talk
ultimately relies on building rapport.

28:30.083 --> 28:32.335
In a negotiation without trust,

28:32.419 --> 28:33.711
there's no victory.

28:33.795 --> 28:35.672
[dramatic music playing]

28:35.755 --> 28:36.589
What about you?

28:37.841 --> 28:40.009
How well do you understand your opponent?

28:40.593 --> 28:42.595
[dramatic music continues playing]

28:52.522 --> 28:53.815
[phone vibrating]

29:18.715 --> 29:20.592
[Hee-joo in distorted voice]
Have you decided?

29:21.050 --> 29:22.010
Is there a reason…

29:23.052 --> 29:24.804
for timing it perfectly?

29:25.472 --> 29:26.723
[Hee-joo] That's up to me.

29:27.432 --> 29:28.266
So?

29:29.559 --> 29:30.685
Have you decided?

29:35.273 --> 29:37.275
[suspenseful music playing]

29:39.235 --> 29:41.362
Will you put everything back or pay me?

29:42.363 --> 29:43.281
[Sa-eon] Before that,

29:44.115 --> 29:45.533
I'm curious about something.

29:46.493 --> 29:47.327
Hong Hee-joo.

29:58.004 --> 29:59.255
The entire nation thinks

29:59.923 --> 30:03.259
Hong In-a, the eldest daughter
of the chairman of Chungwoon, is my wife.

30:04.260 --> 30:05.887
So where did you get…

30:06.554 --> 30:08.515
your information on Hong Hee-joo?

30:10.600 --> 30:11.434
By any chance,

30:13.061 --> 30:14.729
are you close to me?

30:16.022 --> 30:20.026
Considering that no one knows about this
except for family,

30:20.985 --> 30:22.195
you must be close to me.

30:22.278 --> 30:23.154
[Hee-joo] No, wait!

30:23.822 --> 30:25.824
What does that matter right now?

30:26.407 --> 30:27.742
Come on, man.

30:27.826 --> 30:29.744
You still don't get it, do you?

30:30.370 --> 30:32.372
I'm going to bring you down.

30:32.872 --> 30:35.124
I'm going to brand you
with a scarlet letter.

30:37.252 --> 30:38.086
[Sa-eon] I know.

30:38.670 --> 30:39.504
What?

30:39.587 --> 30:40.421
[scoffs]

30:41.130 --> 30:44.300
Some crazy guy
crashed into Hong Hee-joo's car,

30:44.384 --> 30:47.011
stabbed her headrest with a knife,

30:47.095 --> 30:49.764
and left bruises
on her forehead, neck, and shoulders.

30:51.307 --> 30:52.767
Let me be clear.

30:54.143 --> 30:56.938
There will be no compromise.

30:57.522 --> 30:58.523
[inhales]

31:00.692 --> 31:02.026
Do you really think that?

31:03.778 --> 31:06.155
I have something very interesting.

31:06.739 --> 31:07.866
[phone vibrates]

31:09.701 --> 31:11.703
[tense music playing]

31:16.624 --> 31:18.835
How's that? Can you see it?

31:20.086 --> 31:21.713
Still no room for compromise?

31:25.216 --> 31:26.217
[Sa-eon] What is this?

31:28.595 --> 31:31.431
You're her husband,
and you can't recognize that?

31:32.181 --> 31:35.602
Aren't you making it too obvious
that she's not your real wife?

31:35.685 --> 31:37.186
[Sa-eon] I asked what this is.

31:38.146 --> 31:39.564
Be straight with me.

31:40.148 --> 31:41.149
It's Hong Hee-joo's…

31:42.817 --> 31:44.402
[softly] thigh.

31:45.069 --> 31:46.905
I won't say anything right now.

31:47.572 --> 31:49.657
How I'll use this photo

31:49.741 --> 31:51.910
and what kind of story I'll add to it…

31:51.993 --> 31:54.245
I'll leave that to your imagination.

31:54.329 --> 31:55.455
How do I know…

31:56.956 --> 31:58.583
that this is a photo of Hee-joo?

31:59.125 --> 32:01.252
[Hee-joo] What a strange question.

32:01.336 --> 32:03.004
You're supposed to be her husband.

32:03.087 --> 32:05.715
Didn't you know
Hee-joo has a unique mole on her thigh?

32:12.513 --> 32:14.515
How could you not know?

32:15.141 --> 32:17.727
Were you just not interested, or…

32:18.353 --> 32:19.979
have you never seen her naked?

32:20.605 --> 32:21.481
[chuckles]

32:21.564 --> 32:22.774
[Hee-joo sighs]

32:28.321 --> 32:29.489
[music ends]

32:30.657 --> 32:33.493
406, are you married?

32:35.662 --> 32:36.621
What?

32:36.704 --> 32:38.039
[Sa-eon] Are you married?

32:38.873 --> 32:40.708
Yeah, I mean, no!

32:41.709 --> 32:44.921
When was your first time with a woman?

32:45.004 --> 32:47.799
- Excuse me? What?
- [Sa-eon] I'm asking you a question.

32:47.882 --> 32:48.841
[bangs table]

32:49.342 --> 32:51.094
Answer me, you perverted bastard.

32:51.177 --> 32:52.929
- [Hee-joo] Pervert?
- Yeah.

32:53.721 --> 32:55.682
A pervert who uses a cheap fake photo

32:55.765 --> 32:58.476
to fantasize about, harass,
and slander my wife.

32:59.060 --> 33:00.937
I guess blackmail isn't enough,

33:01.604 --> 33:03.564
so I'll add one more
to your list of offenses.

33:03.648 --> 33:05.650
[quirky music playing]

33:06.317 --> 33:09.153
Article 13
of the Act of Sexual Violence Crimes,

33:09.237 --> 33:11.197
obscenity crimes
using communication media.

33:11.906 --> 33:13.241
Sexual violence?

33:13.324 --> 33:14.826
If you want to threaten me,

33:15.410 --> 33:17.495
then you'd better do your research on me.

33:18.121 --> 33:20.498
I know her better than anyone.

33:21.332 --> 33:22.834
Don't throw random things.

33:22.917 --> 33:23.793
[scoffs]

33:24.544 --> 33:25.503
You know her well?

33:26.170 --> 33:28.881
What do you know?
You're just pretending to be her husband.

33:28.965 --> 33:30.258
It's not a fake photo.

33:30.341 --> 33:31.968
You should check for yourself.

33:32.051 --> 33:36.014
See if that's her thigh or not!
Check for yourself!

33:43.980 --> 33:44.981
Wait…

33:48.026 --> 33:49.402
What did I just say?

33:51.529 --> 33:53.156
- Did you get the signal?
- Yes.

33:53.239 --> 33:54.574
Exceeding ten minutes helped.

33:54.657 --> 33:56.200
[serious music playing]

33:56.284 --> 33:58.911
The presumed location
is Seocho, Gangnam, or Yongsan.

33:58.995 --> 34:00.872
It's a rough estimate, but yes.

34:00.955 --> 34:04.042
We will identify the suspect
based on the clues I provide.

34:04.125 --> 34:07.211
When I asked him if he was married,
he changed his answer.

34:07.295 --> 34:10.381
When flustered,
the first response is often the truth.

34:11.049 --> 34:13.843
However, there's a chance
he's divorced recently

34:13.926 --> 34:15.344
or considering it.

34:15.428 --> 34:17.096
- Take a broad approach.
- Yes, sir.

34:17.180 --> 34:19.849
And he was flustered
when I asked him a sexual question.

34:19.932 --> 34:21.601
So he might have a prior.

34:21.684 --> 34:24.479
Check all sex offenders
and search the dark web.

34:24.562 --> 34:25.730
- Yes, sir!
- [man] Yes, sir!

34:26.522 --> 34:27.523
Yes, sir.

34:27.607 --> 34:29.609
Also, find the source of this photo…

34:31.736 --> 34:34.655
[Hee-joo in distorted voice]
It's Hong Hee-joo's thigh.

34:34.739 --> 34:35.740
[Do-jae] Sir?

34:36.783 --> 34:38.284
Never mind. Get started.

34:42.246 --> 34:43.790
[door opens, slams]

34:46.709 --> 34:48.127
He seems really angry.

34:51.881 --> 34:53.508
[Hee-joo groans] I must be crazy!

34:53.591 --> 34:55.760
Check what? What?

34:56.803 --> 34:57.637
[exhales]

34:58.471 --> 34:59.639
[scoffs]

34:59.722 --> 35:00.973
But what? A fake photo?

35:01.891 --> 35:05.394
Does he know how hard I worked
to take that photo?

35:06.187 --> 35:07.980
[electronic music playing]

35:08.689 --> 35:09.690
[camera shutter clicks]

35:13.236 --> 35:15.780
[camera shutter clicking]

35:21.077 --> 35:22.912
[camera shutter clicking]

35:40.263 --> 35:41.264
[camera shutter clicks]

35:47.353 --> 35:48.354
[music ends]

35:48.437 --> 35:51.107
"I know her better than anyone."

35:51.190 --> 35:53.025
"Don't throw random things…"

35:53.693 --> 35:55.778
What does he know?

35:55.862 --> 35:57.071
[door slams]

35:57.697 --> 35:59.740
[suspenseful music playing]

36:01.784 --> 36:02.618
[sighs]

36:04.912 --> 36:05.913
[door beeps]

36:08.624 --> 36:09.500
[gasps]

36:14.755 --> 36:15.590
[exhales]

36:18.176 --> 36:19.010
[sighs]

36:20.803 --> 36:21.929
[sighs]

36:28.728 --> 36:29.729
[sighs]

36:31.063 --> 36:32.648
[door lock beeping]

36:33.524 --> 36:34.525
[door closes]

36:41.282 --> 36:43.284
[breathing heavily]

36:53.961 --> 36:55.087
[door closes]

36:55.588 --> 36:56.714
[Hee-joo] What the heck?

36:57.506 --> 36:58.549
[footsteps echoing]

36:59.342 --> 37:00.801
[mellow music playing]

37:01.844 --> 37:03.179
Why is he coming?

37:44.804 --> 37:46.806
[dramatic music playing]

38:16.669 --> 38:17.920
[music ends]

38:22.842 --> 38:23.676
[sighs softly]

38:26.887 --> 38:28.222
The presidential office

38:28.931 --> 38:31.892
will announce that they are recruiting
a sign language interpreter soon.

38:33.019 --> 38:34.854
You said you wanted to keep working.

38:34.937 --> 38:36.147
There are no privileges.

38:37.023 --> 38:38.107
If you want to do it,

38:38.691 --> 38:40.401
earn your spot beside me.

38:43.571 --> 38:44.488
[door opens]

38:45.740 --> 38:47.700
- [door closes]
- The presidential office?

38:51.495 --> 38:52.830
All of a sudden?

38:57.793 --> 38:58.627
[lid snaps]

39:04.258 --> 39:05.092
[exhales]

39:06.218 --> 39:07.136
[sighs]

39:13.809 --> 39:14.810
[sighs]

39:18.397 --> 39:20.941
3 YEARS AGO

39:21.025 --> 39:22.777
[mellow music playing]

39:26.530 --> 39:27.615
[chuckles softly]

39:35.623 --> 39:36.624
[clears throat]

39:38.751 --> 39:39.710
Did you make this?

39:41.295 --> 39:42.505
Let's say we ate it.

39:43.589 --> 39:45.174
What's next?

40:05.945 --> 40:07.947
[mellow music continues playing]

40:26.424 --> 40:27.258
Hong Hee-joo.

40:28.050 --> 40:28.884
Look at me.

40:30.136 --> 40:32.471
[dramatic music playing]

40:45.776 --> 40:46.986
Do you want a tip?

40:51.699 --> 40:54.285
Don't try to have any feelings for me.

40:55.494 --> 40:56.328
Let it all go.

40:57.872 --> 41:00.583
You don't need to act like a puppet
in front of me.

41:01.167 --> 41:03.335
Don't do everything your mother tells you.

41:10.551 --> 41:11.886
Let me be clear.

41:12.470 --> 41:14.054
You weren't part of my plan.

41:14.138 --> 41:15.431
So, from now on,

41:16.348 --> 41:18.309
if you interfere or get in my way,

41:19.310 --> 41:20.436
I won't let it slide.

41:24.315 --> 41:25.232
[door opens]

41:26.817 --> 41:27.693
[door closes]

41:34.992 --> 41:35.910
[Sa-eon sighs]

41:39.497 --> 41:40.539
[music ends]

41:49.048 --> 41:50.132
[sighs]

42:01.519 --> 42:03.103
[soft music playing]

42:08.234 --> 42:11.779
How could he barge into my room
in the middle of the night like that?

42:22.998 --> 42:24.917
But why didn't he check?

42:27.211 --> 42:28.796
He didn't even ask me.

42:33.634 --> 42:35.094
[groans] Why do I care?

42:36.929 --> 42:38.055
[sighs]

42:39.265 --> 42:40.099
Calm down.

42:41.058 --> 42:42.268
I was just startled.

42:44.228 --> 42:45.813
[sighs] Just sleep.

42:49.358 --> 42:51.360
[heart beating]

43:08.419 --> 43:10.170
[You-ri]
Ahead of the presidential election,

43:10.254 --> 43:12.756
the results of HBC's public opinion poll
are in.

43:13.340 --> 43:15.634
Paik Ui-yong
of the Liberty and Justice Party

43:15.718 --> 43:18.012
- ranked first in the public opinion poll.
- [gasps]

43:18.679 --> 43:19.847
Did you see a ghost?

43:19.930 --> 43:21.307
Why are you so surprised?

43:21.390 --> 43:25.269
[You-ri] …in the simulated competition,
Paik Ui-young takes the lead…

43:26.687 --> 43:27.855
I'll go in the afternoon.

43:31.900 --> 43:33.068
What about breakfast?

43:35.696 --> 43:36.989
I never skip breakfast.

43:38.198 --> 43:41.201
[Hee-joo] He's telling me
to make breakfast, isn't he?

43:46.957 --> 43:48.667
[coffee machine beeps, buzzing]

43:49.752 --> 43:50.669
[beeps]

43:50.753 --> 43:52.296
No coffee on an empty stomach.

43:54.381 --> 43:56.383
[mellow music playing]

44:00.638 --> 44:01.472
Cutting board.

44:12.441 --> 44:13.442
Knife.

44:19.698 --> 44:20.532
Pan.

44:27.623 --> 44:28.457
Turn it on.

44:33.045 --> 44:34.546
[utensil clanking]

44:41.095 --> 44:42.680
[mellow music continues playing]

45:06.745 --> 45:07.913
You'll get new guards.

45:09.039 --> 45:10.833
I heard they lost you at the courthouse.

45:13.836 --> 45:14.670
[Hee-joo] That was…

45:19.091 --> 45:20.592
Then what happened?

45:21.301 --> 45:22.136
What did you do?

45:28.267 --> 45:29.351
[Hee-joo] A college friend.

45:30.102 --> 45:30.978
A college friend?

45:34.606 --> 45:35.482
Were you close?

45:39.903 --> 45:40.779
Are they trustworthy?

45:42.823 --> 45:45.951
Is this friend someone you can trust?

45:46.034 --> 45:48.036
[mellow music continues playing]

46:03.385 --> 46:04.303
[Sa-eon scoffs]

46:04.970 --> 46:07.306
[Sa-eon] And all this time, I thought…

46:07.890 --> 46:10.350
you were quietly and obediently living
under my control.

46:13.437 --> 46:14.480
Was I mistaken?

46:22.154 --> 46:23.697
[heart beating]

46:36.877 --> 46:37.753
Eat it all.

46:38.712 --> 46:39.963
[phone vibrates]

46:43.509 --> 46:44.968
ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICER PARK DO-JAE

46:45.052 --> 46:47.721
[Do-jae] The preliminary
voice analysis results are in.

46:51.183 --> 46:52.351
[door opens]

46:52.434 --> 46:54.895
- [Hee-joo] Did he make this for me?
- [door closes]

46:59.107 --> 47:02.027
HE'S A GOOD PERSON.

47:02.110 --> 47:03.987
I'LL ALWAYS BE WITH YOU!

47:04.071 --> 47:05.697
MY YOUTH SHINES BECAUSE OF YOU!

47:05.781 --> 47:07.783
[indistinct chatter]

47:25.300 --> 47:26.802
Excuse me.

47:27.344 --> 47:28.929
- [fan 1] It's him!
- [fan 2] He's here!

47:29.012 --> 47:30.514
- [fans clamoring]
- [You-ri yelps]

47:35.602 --> 47:36.603
[You-ri exclaims]

47:38.855 --> 47:40.190
[upbeat music playing]

47:53.412 --> 47:55.330
[fans clamoring]

48:00.460 --> 48:01.295
Are you okay?

48:06.842 --> 48:07.676
[gasps]

48:08.343 --> 48:10.387
What about you? Are you okay?

48:13.890 --> 48:14.808
Yes.

48:16.143 --> 48:17.269
- [You-ri groans]
- That's hot.

48:19.563 --> 48:20.397
JI SANG-WOO

48:20.480 --> 48:24.026
Oh my. You're the one
appearing on our show.

48:24.568 --> 48:25.527
[Sang-woo chuckles]

48:25.611 --> 48:26.445
Yeah.

48:26.528 --> 48:27.988
I came for the pre-interview.

48:28.071 --> 48:30.032
And suffered a disaster.

48:31.074 --> 48:32.034
Sorry about that.

48:32.117 --> 48:33.410
No, don't say that.

48:33.493 --> 48:34.953
Those fans are a nuisance.

48:35.704 --> 48:36.788
Such a fuss.

48:38.081 --> 48:39.791
Wait a second.

48:39.875 --> 48:41.043
[quirky music playing]

48:41.126 --> 48:42.836
"Fans are a nuisance"?

48:42.919 --> 48:44.338
It's a fuss?

48:45.756 --> 48:47.007
[scoffs] I mean,

48:47.507 --> 48:51.553
to catch music shows or pre-recordings,
you have to buy an album, join a fan club,

48:51.637 --> 48:55.682
come early, wait in line, and keep waiting
if the recording is delayed.

48:56.391 --> 48:57.601
It's not a fuss.

48:58.268 --> 49:00.937
It should be called devotion.

49:01.897 --> 49:04.941
Have you ever burned with passion
about anyone before?

49:06.943 --> 49:09.488
My arm's feeling pretty burned.

49:10.238 --> 49:11.782
Oh, that…

49:13.075 --> 49:13.950
Sorry about that.

49:15.452 --> 49:19.581
If having a crush on someone is
somewhat similar to being someone's fan…

49:20.707 --> 49:23.377
Then, yes. I've done it before.

49:24.336 --> 49:26.588
What about you? Who are you a fan of?

49:28.215 --> 49:29.591
[You-ri] Well…

49:30.175 --> 49:31.468
He has a nice voice.

49:33.136 --> 49:33.970
A singer?

49:34.054 --> 49:35.055
Mmm-mmm.

49:36.056 --> 49:37.307
He's handsome.

49:37.391 --> 49:38.308
An actor?

49:39.351 --> 49:42.437
He's someone who's respected
and loved by the nation.

49:42.521 --> 49:44.147
I'll leave it at that.

49:45.107 --> 49:46.108
Anyway,

49:47.067 --> 49:49.736
call me if you end up having to go
to the hospital.

49:56.952 --> 49:58.120
[music ends]

50:00.080 --> 50:01.540
NA YOU-RI
HBC ANCHOR

50:13.009 --> 50:14.344
HEE-JOO

50:25.188 --> 50:28.567
[Hee-joo in distorted voice] Come on, man.
You still don't get it, do you?

50:29.234 --> 50:30.777
I'm going to bring you down.

50:31.611 --> 50:34.406
I'm going to brand you
with a scarlet letter.

50:36.700 --> 50:37.659
[sighs]

50:39.911 --> 50:42.956
It's hard to identify someone with this.

50:43.039 --> 50:43.999
I'm sorry.

50:44.082 --> 50:46.084
It's not a typical voice changer.

50:46.168 --> 50:47.419
The voice is encrypted.

50:47.502 --> 50:50.005
- We need time to decrypt--
- I don't care how.

50:50.088 --> 50:52.048
Tell me when you get results.

50:52.132 --> 50:53.425
Yes, sir.

50:53.508 --> 50:56.845
We filtered through the records of sex
offenders and searched the dark web.

50:56.928 --> 51:00.599
I looked into vehicle 1575's dashcam,
and it was off at that time.

51:03.059 --> 51:03.894
But…

51:06.354 --> 51:07.189
Never mind.

51:07.898 --> 51:08.732
What is it?

51:09.524 --> 51:12.319
I tried enhancing the quality
of the footage yesterday,

51:12.402 --> 51:14.029
and I found something strange.

51:14.654 --> 51:16.156
[mysterious music playing]

51:18.950 --> 51:19.868
It's this part.

51:22.871 --> 51:23.955
Stop.

51:24.039 --> 51:24.873
Rewind it.

51:27.375 --> 51:29.377
Here. Zoom in.

51:41.264 --> 51:44.059
[nurse] He'll be so happy
to see his daughter.

51:44.142 --> 51:46.561
He's been doing great lately.

51:47.729 --> 51:50.607
[Jin-cheol] Our club's treasure!
Our club's pride!

51:50.690 --> 51:52.317
Let's give a round of applause!

51:52.400 --> 51:55.111
Kim Yeon-hui!

51:55.195 --> 51:56.112
Goodness!

51:56.196 --> 51:58.198
[funky music playing on stereo]

52:01.660 --> 52:03.161
Good grief.

52:03.995 --> 52:04.830
[music stops]

52:06.498 --> 52:08.458
[nurse] Why would you pick today
to do this?

52:08.542 --> 52:10.335
Put this on now! Quickly!

52:12.838 --> 52:13.922
I'm so sorry.

52:14.005 --> 52:16.424
He was fine just this morning.

52:16.967 --> 52:17.968
[nurse sighs]

52:27.185 --> 52:28.228
[sighs wearily]

52:28.311 --> 52:29.771
How many times have I told you?

52:29.855 --> 52:32.732
You won't need to perform
at nightclubs again, Dad.

52:44.244 --> 52:45.328
There you go.

52:47.247 --> 52:48.498
Is it good?

52:49.082 --> 52:51.751
No matter what I bring,
you insist on eating that.

52:51.835 --> 52:52.878
[Hee-joo chuckles softly]

52:57.716 --> 52:59.009
Don't go.

53:00.385 --> 53:03.388
Yeon-hui, I'll do better.

53:04.097 --> 53:05.098
So please…

53:06.349 --> 53:07.767
Please don't go, Yeon-hui.

53:09.561 --> 53:11.563
[slow music playing]

53:12.397 --> 53:13.899
You should've said that…

53:16.067 --> 53:18.361
when Mom packed her bags to leave.

53:22.032 --> 53:24.200
Why didn't you say that then?

53:24.284 --> 53:26.953
You made a living
with that mouth of yours all your life,

53:27.537 --> 53:30.582
so you could've at least yelled
or cursed at her!

53:32.542 --> 53:33.877
Or…

53:35.879 --> 53:38.757
at least you could've kept me with you.

53:42.469 --> 53:46.264
Our daughter's dream
is to become an anchor.

53:47.223 --> 53:48.141
Isn't that cool?

53:49.643 --> 53:50.560
So…

53:51.436 --> 53:53.939
raise Hee-joo well so she can be an anchor

53:54.606 --> 53:57.651
at a proper broadcasting station

53:57.734 --> 53:59.110
and won't end up

54:00.028 --> 54:01.988
in cheap nightclubs like I did.

54:03.156 --> 54:04.032
Okay?

54:11.039 --> 54:11.873
Is that why…

54:14.751 --> 54:16.086
you sent me away?

54:16.670 --> 54:19.089
[slow music continues playing]

54:19.172 --> 54:20.674
[exhales]

54:24.344 --> 54:25.595
But Dad…

54:31.810 --> 54:33.812
[voice shaking] Dad, the thing is…

54:34.938 --> 54:36.189
[crying]

54:36.272 --> 54:39.651
ever since I became Hong Hee-joo
instead of Na Hee-joo,

54:39.734 --> 54:42.612
I've never had a day of peace.

54:42.696 --> 54:45.865
I pretend to be mute,
living in Hong In-a's shadow.

54:45.949 --> 54:49.577
I don't remember who I am anymore.

54:51.329 --> 54:55.208
[crying] I'm so sick of this.
I want to quit.

54:57.419 --> 55:00.880
[sobbing] Dad!

55:04.759 --> 55:05.802
[music ends]

55:21.651 --> 55:22.485
[Hyeok-jin] Threats?

55:22.569 --> 55:24.654
[jazz music playing on speakers]

55:24.738 --> 55:25.822
Wait.

55:26.656 --> 55:28.533
A man sends a photo of the wife's naked--

55:28.616 --> 55:29.826
She wasn't naked.

55:29.909 --> 55:30.910
Either way.

55:30.994 --> 55:33.163
He sends a sleazy photo

55:33.246 --> 55:36.124
and threatens the husband
to end it with his wife.

55:37.125 --> 55:37.959
Yeah.

55:38.460 --> 55:39.919
What does that sound like?

55:41.087 --> 55:42.756
It's obvious. I'm sure…

55:45.675 --> 55:46.760
Hey.

55:46.843 --> 55:47.886
Who is this about?

55:48.595 --> 55:50.722
Don't ask. You're sure of what?

55:50.805 --> 55:53.266
What do you think? It's obvious.

55:54.809 --> 55:55.810
I'm certain…

55:56.936 --> 55:58.146
it's an affair.

55:58.229 --> 56:00.231
[suspenseful music playing]

56:02.567 --> 56:04.944
I thought the car was forcibly taken,

56:05.028 --> 56:06.821
but he got in very naturally.

56:06.905 --> 56:09.574
As if she opened the door for him.

56:15.997 --> 56:17.207
[phone vibrating]

56:28.885 --> 56:30.136
[phone vibrating]

56:45.110 --> 56:46.236
[phone vibrating]

56:51.825 --> 56:52.742
[Hee-joo] Hello--

56:57.205 --> 56:58.289
[sighs]

56:58.373 --> 57:00.416
[Hee-joo] What was that? Did he hang up?

57:01.084 --> 57:02.502
PAIK SA-EON

57:02.585 --> 57:03.711
[line ringing]

57:04.379 --> 57:06.256
Paik Sa-eon, I dare you to hang up again!

57:06.339 --> 57:07.841
- [Sa-eon] I'm hanging up.
- Wait!

57:08.633 --> 57:11.219
[Sa-eon] Now it's hard to tell
who's more desperate.

57:11.886 --> 57:14.764
I won't stay quiet if you act this way.

57:14.848 --> 57:16.015
[Sa-eon] Wait.

57:16.099 --> 57:17.016
What?

57:18.560 --> 57:20.395
[Sa-eon] If you want
to talk to me that badly,

57:20.478 --> 57:21.771
then wait.

57:24.983 --> 57:26.734
A pervert like you

57:27.444 --> 57:29.404
deserves a penalty like this.

57:30.488 --> 57:31.948
Be good and wait.

57:32.031 --> 57:34.367
- Call me back in five minutes.
- [line disconnects]

57:34.451 --> 57:35.285
PAIK SA-EON

57:39.831 --> 57:41.207
Is he out of his mind?

57:41.791 --> 57:43.084
PAIK SA-EON

57:43.168 --> 57:44.335
[line ringing]

57:44.961 --> 57:46.629
[automated voice] The person you're…

57:48.173 --> 57:49.507
[line ringing]

57:49.591 --> 57:51.634
[automated voice] The person
you're trying to call…

57:51.718 --> 57:52.760
[line disconnects]

57:53.845 --> 57:54.679
[line ringing]

57:54.762 --> 57:56.222
[automated voice] The person you're…

57:56.306 --> 57:57.265
[line disconnects]

57:57.390 --> 57:59.392
[tense music playing]

58:00.935 --> 58:02.270
[Sa-eon sighs]

58:49.067 --> 58:49.984
[music ends]

58:53.154 --> 58:54.113
PAIK SA-EON

58:54.197 --> 58:55.198
[line ringing]

58:56.324 --> 58:57.617
[phone vibrating]

59:00.870 --> 59:01.704
[sighs softly]

59:03.748 --> 59:04.832
[Hee-joo] Stay calm.

59:05.500 --> 59:07.919
Do not get worked up. [inhales]

59:08.002 --> 59:09.045
[phone vibrating]

59:15.301 --> 59:16.553
[suspenseful music playing]

59:20.056 --> 59:21.891
- Stay calm…
- [Sa-eon] Good job.

59:23.017 --> 59:25.979
From now on, wait on all fours like that.

59:27.021 --> 59:28.940
[Hee-joo] Do not get worked up.

59:29.023 --> 59:30.024
Who knows?

59:30.733 --> 59:33.236
I might even throw you a bone.

59:33.319 --> 59:34.404
What did you say, bastard?

59:34.487 --> 59:36.281
What are you trying to do?

59:36.364 --> 59:39.534
I really won't stand for this.
Don't regret this later.

59:42.120 --> 59:43.580
- [explosion]
- [Hee-joo yelps]

59:43.663 --> 59:45.915
[ears ringing]

59:50.044 --> 59:51.087
[ringing stops]

59:54.799 --> 59:56.801
[breathing heavily]

01:00:07.854 --> 01:00:09.272
[solemn music playing]

01:00:10.148 --> 01:00:11.065
PAIK SA-EON

01:00:11.983 --> 01:00:13.610
[breathing heavily]

01:00:14.193 --> 01:00:17.614
The phone you called is turned off.
You'll be directed to voicemail.

01:00:18.531 --> 01:00:20.825
- [sighs]
- Additional fees may apply after the beep.

01:00:20.908 --> 01:00:22.910
[solemn music continues playing]

01:00:24.454 --> 01:00:25.622
[door lock beeping]

01:00:26.664 --> 01:00:27.665
[door opens]

01:00:29.083 --> 01:00:30.084
[door closes]

01:00:44.891 --> 01:00:45.725
[breath trembling]

01:00:51.356 --> 01:00:53.149
[solemn music continues playing]

01:00:55.652 --> 01:00:57.987
PAIK SA-EON

01:00:58.780 --> 01:01:00.907
[automated voice] The phone you called
is turned off.

01:01:00.990 --> 01:01:02.992
You'll be directed to voicemail.

01:01:03.076 --> 01:01:04.410
Additional fees…

01:01:23.179 --> 01:01:24.347
[music ends]

01:01:42.115 --> 01:01:42.949
[TV beeps]

01:01:43.032 --> 01:01:44.992
[male reporter] …is expected
to move northward

01:01:45.076 --> 01:01:47.912
and emphasized that we must stay vigilant.

01:01:48.871 --> 01:01:49.831
[You-ri] Breaking news.

01:01:49.914 --> 01:01:51.582
At 10:07 p.m. last night,

01:01:51.666 --> 01:01:53.876
there was an explosion
in an office in Yeouido,

01:01:53.960 --> 01:01:56.212
resulting in injuries.

01:01:56.295 --> 01:01:59.465
The fire department
is investigating the cause of the fire.

01:01:59.549 --> 01:02:01.217
Let's go to the scene now.

01:02:01.884 --> 01:02:04.053
[reporter] A man dressed in black
with a cap on

01:02:04.137 --> 01:02:06.180
climbs the stairs with a delivery bag.

01:02:06.264 --> 01:02:08.975
He takes what looks like a pizza box
out of the bag

01:02:09.058 --> 01:02:10.560
and enters the fifth-floor hallway.

01:02:10.643 --> 01:02:14.480
Moments later, bright red flames spread
and black smoke rises.

01:02:14.564 --> 01:02:17.692
This is the office
where six people were injured.

01:02:17.775 --> 01:02:21.946
Smoke lingers, with the victims'
computer fragments scattered around.

01:02:22.029 --> 01:02:24.907
According to reports,
the perpetrator held a grudge

01:02:24.991 --> 01:02:27.243
and repeatedly made
threatening phone calls,

01:02:27.326 --> 01:02:28.870
hinting at the planned crime.

01:02:28.953 --> 01:02:32.498
HBC has an exclusive recording
of the perpetrator's phone call.

01:02:32.582 --> 01:02:35.209
[in distorted voice]
You have until tomorrow to decide.

01:02:38.629 --> 01:02:40.423
[dramatic music playing]

01:02:40.506 --> 01:02:43.593
Or we can settle for two billion won.
You have until tomorrow.

01:02:43.676 --> 01:02:45.887
I was going to kill her. Do you get it?

01:02:46.637 --> 01:02:48.139
Come on, man.

01:02:48.222 --> 01:02:49.932
You still don't get it, do you?

01:02:50.516 --> 01:02:52.769
The perpetrator,
who had been making threats,

01:02:52.852 --> 01:02:55.354
set fire to the victim's office
last night,

01:02:55.438 --> 01:02:57.190
- The fire department…
- A fire?

01:02:59.734 --> 01:03:01.068
When did I do that?

01:03:01.152 --> 01:03:04.197
- There could've been casualties…
- [door opens, closes]

01:03:05.948 --> 01:03:08.284
[reporter] The police,
fire department, and forensics

01:03:08.367 --> 01:03:10.036
are conducting an investigation.

01:03:10.620 --> 01:03:13.790
They'll form a dedicated team
to look into the incident.

01:03:13.873 --> 01:03:15.500
This was Jang Seok-hyeon with HBC.

01:03:16.250 --> 01:03:18.336
[tense music playing]

01:03:19.587 --> 01:03:20.421
[sighs]

01:03:52.328 --> 01:03:53.162
Lately,

01:03:55.122 --> 01:03:56.749
nothing makes sense.

01:03:57.917 --> 01:03:59.335
[tense music continues]

01:04:00.628 --> 01:04:03.089
There can't be a Hong Hee-joo
I don't know about.

01:04:09.512 --> 01:04:10.930
I need to find out

01:04:12.014 --> 01:04:13.432
which one is the real one.

01:04:14.976 --> 01:04:16.310
Right now,

01:04:17.103 --> 01:04:18.521
you're my only lead.

01:04:22.066 --> 01:04:23.609
So cooperate.

01:04:31.450 --> 01:04:32.785
Do you want to take it off…

01:04:35.955 --> 01:04:37.248
or should I?

01:04:39.500 --> 01:04:41.168
[dramatic music playing]

01:04:54.515 --> 01:04:57.435
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

01:04:57.518 --> 01:05:03.232
3 YEARS AGO

01:05:04.191 --> 01:05:05.192
[phone vibrates]

01:05:08.988 --> 01:05:10.489
[In-a] Have you decided?

01:05:12.116 --> 01:05:14.493
Cancel the wedding tomorrow.

01:05:14.577 --> 01:05:17.371
Make sure this arranged marriage
never happens.

01:05:21.584 --> 01:05:22.585
[sighs]

01:05:23.669 --> 01:05:26.422
[In-a] Or I'll expose
all of your family secrets.

01:05:32.470 --> 01:05:33.304
[sighs]

01:05:39.018 --> 01:05:40.561
[Sa-eon] Let me ask you something too.

01:05:42.480 --> 01:05:43.397
Is Hong Hee-joo…

01:05:51.822 --> 01:05:52.907
[sighs]

01:05:54.116 --> 01:05:56.243
marrying the son
of the Yeonghwa Construction family?

01:05:57.161 --> 01:05:58.120
Is that true?

01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:05.002
[tense music playing]

01:06:06.796 --> 01:06:07.755
[sighs]

01:06:13.344 --> 01:06:14.178
[phone vibrates]

01:06:15.388 --> 01:06:16.722
[In-a] It's true.

01:06:18.391 --> 01:06:19.725
[exhales heavily]

01:06:20.309 --> 01:06:22.103
[In-a] That piece of trash
is the last person

01:06:22.186 --> 01:06:24.188
that daughters of influential families
would marry.

01:06:24.271 --> 01:06:28.776
And the only woman willing to sell
her daughter to him is Hee-joo's mom.

01:06:35.491 --> 01:06:38.285
[Sa-eon] The wedding will be held
as planned tomorrow.

01:06:39.203 --> 01:06:40.037
However,

01:06:41.580 --> 01:06:42.999
let's switch the bride.

01:06:44.750 --> 01:06:47.586
[In-a] What are you saying?
You don't mean…

01:06:52.466 --> 01:06:55.302
[Sa-eon] It won't be you.
It'll be your sister.

01:07:37.720 --> 01:07:40.639
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

01:07:41.432 --> 01:07:43.476
[Sa-eon] You don't know
what I'm trying to do

01:07:43.976 --> 01:07:45.770
or what I'm trying to see, right?

01:07:46.479 --> 01:07:48.731
Interpreter Hong Hee-joo?

01:07:50.232 --> 01:07:51.358
Do you like her?

01:07:52.318 --> 01:07:54.945
[Hee-joo] Do you suspect me and Sang-woo?

01:07:55.696 --> 01:07:57.239
[Sa-eon] You know him so well.

01:07:57.323 --> 01:07:59.658
What about me?
How much do you know about me?

01:08:00.117 --> 01:08:02.161
[kidnaper] Sis!

01:08:03.037 --> 01:08:05.790
Call him. Keep calling him.

01:08:05.873 --> 01:08:07.124
[Hee-joo] Dad!

01:08:08.793 --> 01:08:10.795
Just think of it as a bad dream.

01:08:11.420 --> 01:08:12.421
Forget it all.

01:08:16.383 --> 01:08:18.385
Subtitle translation by: Sue Mounce
